|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| Array/Struct  |                             |              | After user array partition and struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied       |
|               | (1) array partition         | 1,187        | user array partition pragmas are applied                                               |
|               | (2) simplification          | 1,035        | simplification of applied user array partition & struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas |
|               | (3) aggregate/disaggregate  | 1,045        | user struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied                                 |
|               | (4) array reshape           | 1,177        | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns         | 1,243        | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                             |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
|               | (1) loop simplification     | 1,244        | loop and instruction simplification                                                    |
|               | (2) parallelization         | 1,222        | loops are unrolled or pipelined to meet performance targets                            |
